Pro-800 Manager Plugin

Remote control for the Behringer Pro-800 synthesizer, and a manager for
its stored presets: import, export, move, copy and rename.

This installer offers the standalone application (in /Applications) and
the VST3 and AU plugins (in /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3 and
/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components). Connect the Pro-800 by USB, pick its
port and press Connect.

The installer and the binaries are not signed, so macOS asks you to allow
them (System Settings > Privacy & Security).

